[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
INN++ is installed in %%NEWSBASE%%, with its configuration in
%%CONFDIR%%.  A minimal active file and an empty history database
were made in %%DBDIR%% if none were there.

Configure INN (inn.conf, readers.conf, incoming.conf, newsfeeds), then
start it:

  sysrc innd_enable=YES
  service innd start

This is an alpha release, not for production use.
EOM
}
]
